      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofzavalla.com/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cassels Boykin Park, Zavalla’s largest park, spans 265 acres and offers boat ramps, fishing, and swimming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
